# Every license in the environment, and where the string came from.
#
# Regenerated by `pixi run demo`. See docs/development.md; the input is staged by
# scripts/demo-workspace.sh so the run needs no network and looks the same every time.

Output "docs/assets/report-licenses.gif"
Source "docs/assets/_common.tape"
Set Height 1140

Hide
Type `cd "$DEMO_WORKSPACE" && PS1='$ '` Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Ctrl+L
Show

Sleep 400ms
Type "pixi sbom -e web -p linux-64 -q --report licenses" Sleep 200ms Enter
Sleep 2500ms
